# HAJR LIVE V12 - Master Architecture Directives
- Database: PostgreSQL 13+ (Strict ACID).
- Currency: BIGINT exclusively (minor units).
- Dual-Ledger: `real_coins` (purchased) and `promo_coins` (free).
- Negative Balances: Strictly forbidden, EXCEPT for the `chargeback_ledger`.
- Immutability: All ledgers are APPEND-ONLY (No UPDATE/DELETE/TRUNCATE).
